never looked that good.

1493
01:04:42,467 --> 01:04:43,667
- Beautiful girl.

1494
01:04:48,200 --> 01:04:49,900
- My name is Linda.

1495
01:04:49,933 --> 01:04:51,600
- [Crow] My name is Lucky.

1496
01:04:51,633 --> 01:04:52,467
- Linda.

1497
01:04:54,267 --> 01:04:55,200
Tang.

1498
01:04:55,233 --> 01:04:57,300
- [Tom] I'm not just
for breakfast anymore.

1499
01:04:58,967 --> 01:05:01,367
