I undress.

1504
01:05:14,367 --> 01:05:15,900
- [Joel] Nice bag, Tang.

1505
01:05:18,667 --> 01:05:20,400
- I did not mean to hurt you.

1506
01:05:23,733 --> 01:05:26,100
- [Joel] I can love
only through pain.

1507
01:05:28,900 --> 01:05:30,400
- Do not be afraid of me.

1508
01:05:33,167 --> 01:05:35,267
- I am not afraid of you, Tang.

1509
01:05:39,333 --> 01:05:41,167
- [Tom] Dang-shang-alang, Tang.

1510
01:05:42,067 --> 01:05:44,433
- [Crow] Wang, bang,
thank you Tang.

1511
01:05:47,467 --> 01:05:49,267
(thunder rumbling)

1512
01:05:49,300 --> 01:05:52,433
♪ The weather started
getting rough ♪

1513
01:05:52,467 --> 01:05:54,600
- [Joel] The Tang and
she were tossed.

1514
01:06:03,500 --> 01:06:06,733
(thunder rumbling)

1515
01:06:06,767 --> 01:06:09,133
- [Crow] Dean will get
Liddy and the Plumbers

1516
01:06:09,167 --> 01:06:10,900
