1517
01:06:10,933 --> 01:06:13,333
- [Recording] Navigation
officer, Cosmos Three.

1518
01:06:13,367 --> 01:06:14,733
- [Joel] Hey Crow, sounds
like one of the more

1519
01:06:14,767 --> 01:06:17,267
