That would place him in the
upper end of this canyon.

1523
01:06:28,667 --> 01:06:30,800
Probably a cave high
on the cliff.

1524
01:06:31,967 --> 01:06:32,933
There they'd be fairly safe--

1525
01:06:32,967 --> 01:06:34,667
