1533
01:06:52,467 --> 01:06:54,933
(Joel mumbling)

1534
01:06:54,967 --> 01:06:56,233
- At least we'll be sure.

1535
01:06:58,533 --> 01:07:03,100
- Admiral King, qre the dead
worth more lives of the living?

1536
01:07:03,700 --> 01:07:04,567
- [Tom] What's a dead man

1537
01:07:04,600 --> 01:07:06,500
