Linda is dead either.

1540
01:07:13,133 --> 01:07:14,633
(Crow mumbling)

1541
01:07:14,667 --> 01:07:16,467
She might possibly be a captive.

1542
01:07:16,500 --> 01:07:17,133
- A captive?

1543
01:07:18,267 --> 01:07:22,533
- (mumbling) The serpent
was killed by a metal shaft,

1544
01:07:23,400 --> 01:07:24,333
