There might be primitive
man on this planet.

1546
01:07:29,567 --> 01:07:31,667
- [Tom] Men without
pocket squares.

1547
01:07:31,700 --> 01:07:32,500
- [Crow] Hey, did you
just get back

1548
01:07:32,533 --> 01:07:34,900
