1558
01:08:14,833 --> 01:08:15,633
(cheerful music)

1559
01:08:15,667 --> 01:08:16,500
- [Joel] Yeah.

1560
01:08:20,467 --> 01:08:22,733
- [Crow] Go, Annette, go!

1561
