with a busted ensign.

1580
01:09:10,967 --> 01:09:12,133
- [Tom] A busted ensign,
we all know

1581
01:09:12,167 --> 01:09:13,300
how painful that can be.

1582
01:09:13,333 --> 01:09:14,833
- you wouldn't pull your
rank on a sweet little

1583
01:09:14,867 --> 01:09:17,400
junior officer like this,
just 'cause you're jealous.

1584
01:09:17,433 --> 01:09:19,400
- Mr. Bradley, there
are some men

1585
01:09:19,433 --> 01:09:21,900
