right into orbit.

1586
01:09:21,933 --> 01:09:24,367
You couldn't even get me
onto the launching pad.

1587
01:09:24,400 --> 01:09:26,233
- [Tom] Yikes, nice tag.

1588
01:09:26,267 --> 01:09:27,100
- Mr. Scott!

1589
01:09:28,133 --> 01:09:30,067
- [Crow] Oh, you're over
there, I didn't look.

1590
01:09:30,100 --> 01:09:31,933
Why isn't my field gear ready?

1591
01:09:33,667 --> 01:09:34,700
Bradley!

1592
01:09:34,733 --> 01:09:35,533
- Yes, sir!

1593
01:09:35,567 --> 01:09:36,400
- Where's Mr. Scott?

1594
01:09:38,400 --> 01:09:40,233
Why isn't the search party
ready to leave?

1595
01:09:40,267 --> 01:09:42,800
(Joel mumbling)

1596
01:09:43,800 --> 01:09:46,267
