let anybody else go.

1597
01:09:46,300 --> 01:09:47,133
- Hmm.

1598
01:09:48,100 --> 01:09:48,933
He said that, did he?

1599
01:09:50,100 --> 01:09:53,267
- Those were your orders,
weren't they, admiral?

1600
01:09:53,300 --> 01:09:56,433
- Yes, yes it was.
(Joel mumbling)

1601
01:09:56,467 --> 01:09:57,867
Has he reported in yet?

1602
01:09:57,900 --> 01:09:59,567
(Joel mumbling)

1603
01:09:59,600 --> 01:10:01,567
- He said he would
investigate the waterfall area

1604
01:10:01,600 --> 01:10:02,733
and then report to you.

1605
01:10:04,400 --> 01:10:06,600
