you hear from him.

1606
01:10:06,633 --> 01:10:09,533
- [Tom] Thank you Betty,
Veronica, Jughead.

1607
01:10:09,567 --> 01:10:11,300
- Hey, you know something?

1608
01:10:11,333 --> 01:10:12,533
He didn't tell Scott to go.

1609
01:10:12,567 --> 01:10:14,300
He was gonna go himself.

1610
01:10:14,333 --> 01:10:15,367
- Yes, I know.

1611
01:10:15,400 --> 01:10:17,500
The commander told me
about it last night.

1612
01:10:18,533 --> 01:10:20,000
- [Joel] He was very high.

1613
01:10:25,433 --> 01:10:28,100
- [Crow] We've been walking
around this studio for months!

1614
01:10:28,133 --> 01:10:29,433
- [Tom] We've gone too far,

1615
01:10:29,467 --> 01:10:32,033
we're on the Indian set now,
turn back!

1616
01:10:33,200 --> 01:10:34,700
- Have you searched this
area thoroughly?

1617
01:10:35,600 --> 01:10:36,833
- She isn't here, admiral.

1618
01:10:37,667 --> 01:10:38,533
We can head for the cliff now,

1619
01:10:38,567 --> 01:10:41,700
I'll let you know if we
find anything.

1620
01:10:41,733 --> 01:10:42,833
Yes sir.

1621
01:10:42,867 --> 01:10:44,233
- [Joel] But your bath is ready,
sir.

1622
01:10:47,800 --> 01:10:51,167
- Doc, what kind of metal
would you say this is?

1623
01:10:54,433 --> 01:10:55,867
- Some kind of steel alloy?

1624
01:10:56,833 --> 01:10:59,067
- [Crow] Wrong, but
thanks for playing.

1625
01:10:59,100 --> 01:11:00,933
- What are you driving at?

1626
01:11:01,900 --> 01:11:03,133
- There's only one
kind of device

1627
01:11:03,167 --> 01:11:04,667
