1629
01:11:06,033 --> 01:11:06,867
- A crossbow.

1630
01:11:08,567 --> 01:11:10,833
Maybe a Centaurian crossbow.

1631
01:11:10,867 --> 01:11:11,667
- [Joel] Maybe.

1632
01:11:11,700 --> 01:11:12,800
- Doc, we might be on
the trail of

1633
01:11:12,833 --> 01:11:15,567
the very man who
murdered Captain Ross.

1634
01:11:16,700 --> 01:11:19,200
- [Joel] Let's go check out
the cave set, you slobs.

1635
01:11:21,500 --> 01:11:23,500
(cheerful music)

1636
01:11:23,533 --> 01:11:25,367
- [Joel] Hello, world!

1637
01:11:26,433 --> 01:11:28,167
- [Tom] Peter Pan and Wendy.

1638
01:11:28,200 --> 01:11:30,967
- [Crow] Hey, get me,
I'm a wood nymph!

1639
01:11:31,000 --> 01:11:33,333
- [Joel] My name isn't Tang,
it's Puck.

1640
01:11:33,367 --> 01:11:35,633
Oh, I meant to do my work today,

1641
01:11:35,667 --> 01:11:37,600
but the wildflowers beckoned,

1642
01:11:37,633 --> 01:11:40,767
