but answer their calls?

1643
01:11:40,800 --> 01:11:44,500
Sweetly called by the
stringed lute, and I came.

1644
01:11:46,667 --> 01:11:48,900
- [Tom] That was beautiful.

1645
01:11:50,600 --> 01:11:53,333
- I remember this place, Tang.

1646
01:11:53,367 --> 01:11:54,967
It's so lovely here
and so peaceful.

1647
01:11:55,000 --> 01:11:57,600
- [Tom] This all flows from
the other huts upstream.

1648
01:11:59,033 --> 01:12:00,067
- Here I find Linda.

1649
01:12:06,200 --> 01:12:07,367
Come, we must speak.

1650
