wanna watch this next part.

1651
01:12:08,667 --> 01:12:10,033
We'd better get outta here.

1652
01:12:10,067 --> 01:12:10,900
- [Crow] I kinda do.

1653
01:12:10,933 --> 01:12:12,800
- [Joel] No, you better stay,
come on.

1654
01:12:12,833 --> 01:12:17,833
(mechanical whirring)
(doors closing)

1655
01:12:22,900 --> 01:12:25,933
- No it's the green wire,
