- Oh, that's enough
from the peanut gallery.

1659
01:12:31,067 --> 01:12:32,367
Thanks a lot, you two.

1660
01:12:32,400 --> 01:12:34,900
- Oh heck Joel, go ahead
and clip toe blue wire.

1661
01:12:34,933 --> 01:12:37,033
It's just a doomsday
machine, if it goes up

1662
01:12:37,067 --> 01:12:40,133
it's not like we're gonna be
around to experience oblivion.

1663
01:12:40,167 --> 01:12:41,433
