phenomenological oblivion?

1665
01:12:44,367 --> 01:12:45,667
- Hmm, interesting distinction.

1666
01:12:45,700 --> 01:12:47,500
Let's define our terms,
shall we?

1667
01:12:47,533 --> 01:12:49,000
- Well, Kierkegaard
would always say--

1668
01:12:49,033 --> 01:12:50,233
- Listen you screwheads,
you'd better knock it off

1669
01:12:50,267 --> 01:12:52,933
or I'll brain you both
with my ball-peen hammer,

1670
01:12:52,967 --> 01:12:53,933
now knock it off.

1671
01:12:53,967 --> 01:12:55,167
- Hmm, interesting reaction

1672
01:12:55,200 --> 01:12:56,733
