1673
01:12:56,767 --> 01:12:59,933
I think Camus would have
theorized differently.

1674
01:12:59,967 --> 01:13:02,000
- Oh listen, mister
smart-alec guy,

1675
01:13:02,033 --> 01:13:04,767
