he'd cut the green one.

1678
01:13:09,900 --> 01:13:11,433
- Eeenie, meenie, minie moe--

1679
01:13:11,467 --> 01:13:13,667
- Ah, the Samuel Beckett method.

1680
01:13:13,700 --> 01:13:15,400
- Joel, you're playing
dice with the universe.

1681
01:13:15,433 --> 01:13:17,100
I hope you realize that.

1682
01:13:17,133 --> 01:13:18,300
(bells chiming)

1683
01:13:18,333 --> 01:13:19,200
- [Satellite] Welcome,
you have passed through

1684
01:13:19,233 --> 01:13:20,867
