Literary Satellite,

1686
01:13:22,933 --> 01:13:25,733
Enter the disarm code or
enjoy the consequences.

1687
01:13:25,767 --> 01:13:27,967
Remember, this and all literary
works of the last century

1688
01:13:28,000 --> 01:13:29,467
