1692
01:13:33,667 --> 01:13:34,833
- Quick Joel, cut every wire!

1693
01:13:34,867 --> 01:13:37,267
- It's not gonna work,
it needs an access code!

1694
01:13:37,300 --> 01:13:38,933
- Uh, uh, try ego.

1695
01:13:38,967 --> 01:13:39,833
- Sideburns!

1696
01:13:39,867 --> 01:13:41,133
