1708
01:14:09,967 --> 01:14:11,300
- This is terrible, you guys!

1709
01:14:11,333 --> 01:14:12,900
- Oh, I don't know, at least now

1710
01:14:12,933 --> 01:14:14,133
I'll have something
to write about.

1711
01:14:14,167 --> 01:14:15,133
You know, I've been
thinking about

1712
01:14:15,167 --> 01:14:17,233
annotating the Manhattan
phone directory.

1713
01:14:17,267 --> 01:14:18,733
- Oh, look, it's
commercial sign.

1714
01:14:18,767 --> 01:14:20,100
That'll fit nicely
into my volume

1715
01:14:20,133 --> 01:14:22,400
