1716
01:14:22,433 --> 01:14:26,267
(all talking over each other)

1717
01:14:28,800 --> 01:14:32,367
(instrumental theme music)

1718
01:14:37,267 --> 01:14:41,100
(all talking over each other)

1719
01:14:48,400 --> 01:14:51,267
- I've never seen such
beautiful fruit.

1720
01:14:51,300 --> 01:14:54,300
On Centaurus, at the
colony and on my ship,

1721
